{"id":"596b32c54c6e8f65764403bf274def662cceb895","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1233402","title":"不编程国产 Ai 多模态哪个提问题聪明点？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"revival83","excerpt":"问与答 - @revival83 - 豆包和 Gemini pro 感觉给的答案不太行，买了 deepseek api 但没多模态截图又不能识别","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>豆包和 Gemini pro 感觉给的答案不太行，买了 deepseek api 但没多模态截图又不能识别</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/多模态\"><li></li> 多模态</a><a href=\"/tag/编程\"><li></li> 编程</a></P><p><span>11 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-11 14:50:56 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959097\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c4a8c2c0e54b9af6e5f39404479d1c26?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sir283\" data-uid=\"661572\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sir283\">sir283</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 08:38:48 +08:00\">13h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>试试看千问，听说是目前最强的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959286\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fd3d/e72c/430477_normal.png?m=1569461183\" alt=\"EthanV2\" data-uid=\"430477\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EthanV2\">EthanV2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:11:50 +08:00\">13h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>千问网页版是 3.7+思考模式，3.8MAX ，都能网页搜索。所以国内用这个就行，以前豆包打电话很灵敏，现在都感觉限流了，说一句等好几句才能回信息，就只有豆包输入法更好，我也懒得打字</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959490\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fd3d/e72c/430477_normal.png?m=1569461183\" alt=\"EthanV2\" data-uid=\"430477\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EthanV2\">EthanV2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:36:41 +08:00\">12h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是一样的，app 还多了打电话之类的功能，模型是一样的，在网页版千问算比较大方的，用的都是新模型，gemini ，豆包，都是比较久的，但是很多言论也会受限，并且有一定的导向，但日常用，千问还是很好的，<br>@<a href=\"/member/revival83\">revival83</a> #4</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959626\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6cbf/6315/353550_normal.png?m=1712113908\" alt=\"whatalittleboy\" data-uid=\"353550\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/whatalittleboy\">whatalittleboy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:53:41 +08:00\">12h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>金融数据方面，Kimi 免费快速版已经很强了，能联网搜索数据库。deepseek 搜网页，Gemini 给你编😅</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960731\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/95ce01572fb0579e5f411701f133d235?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"EminX\" data-uid=\"759049\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EminX\">EminX</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 11:59:09 +08:00\">10h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Codex+deepseek 很好用，性价比很高</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17961556\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3869cb5f5d3d57aa393b168ec3516537?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"liaanj\" data-uid=\"664050\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liaanj\">liaanj</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 14:50:56 +08:00\">7h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>豆包开思考会聪明一点，我一般回答不满意空洞的话，开思考就可以了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"豆包和 Gemini pro 感觉给的答案不太行，买了 deepseek api 但没多模态截图又不能识别 AI 多模态 编程11 replies • 2026-08-11 14:50:56 +08:00 1 sir283 13h 50m ago 试试看千问，听说是目前最强的。 3 EthanV2 13h 17m ago 千问网页版是 3.7+思考模式，3.8MAX ，都能网页搜索。所以国内用这个就行，以前豆包打电话很灵敏，现在都感觉限流了，说一句等好几句才能回信息，就只有豆包输入法更好，我也懒得打字 5 EthanV2 12h 52m ago 是一样的，app 还多了打电话之类的功能，模型是一样的，在网页版千问算比较大方的，用的都是新模型，gemini ，豆包，都是比较久的，但是很多言论也会受限，并且有一定的导向，但日常用，千问还是很好的，@revival83 #4 8 whatalittleboy 12h 35m ago 金融数据方面，Kimi 免费快速版已经很强了，能联网搜索数据库。deepseek 搜网页，Gemini 给你编😅 9 EminX 10h 30m ago Codex+deepseek 很好用，性价比很高 11 liaanj 7h 38m ago 豆包开思考会聪明一点，我一般回答不满意空洞的话，开思考就可以了","fetched_at":"2026-08-11T14:29:31.149Z","ok":true}